get_recipe: description  -Get +Call this right after search_recipes returns +matching recipe, before you write the integration code, so you start from files and versions that passed tests. Gets the
list_stacks: description  -List +Call this when the user names a library and you are not sure ProvenPin covers it, or after search_recipes returns nothing. Lists -counts. Call this to check whether ProvenPin covers a library before searching, or after a search returns nothing, and +counts;
search_recipes: description  +when choosing or pinning package versions, when upgrading a library to a new major version (for example SQLAlchemy 2 or Pydantic 2), +deprecation errors
